/E (I am also grateful to my friends and classmates for their collaboration, feedback, and active involvement during design, testing, and implementation phases. Their support significantly contributed to improving the functionality and user experience of the system.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (Finally, I extend deep appreciation to my family for their patience, motivation, and unwavering support, which helped me stay focused and complete the project successfully. I also acknowledge the valuable resources available from open-source communities and online learning platforms, which enriched my technical understanding and assisted in the practical realization of my ideas.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (I would like to express my sincere gratitude to my project guide and faculty members for their insightful guidance and encouragement during the development of my Food Waste Management System. Their expert advice and continuous support helped me overcome technical and logical challenges throughout the project. My heartfelt thanks go to my department and institution for providing the necessary resources and a motivating academic environment. The encouragement and opportunities offered were invaluable in helping me pursue my goals.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
