/P 169 0 R
/E (To overcome these challenges, the proposed Food Waste Management System leverages digital technology to facilitate the effective collection, management, and distribution of surplus food. The system provides distinct interfaces for donors, administrators, and delivery personnel, enabling seamless coordination among all stakeholders. By automating key processes such as donation registration, verification, and assignment of delivery tasks, the platform ensures organized and transparent workflows. Additionally, real-time status updates and database-driven workflows enhance visibility and accountability at every step.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
