/E (The proposed Food Waste Management System is a comprehensive web-based platform designed to tackle the challenges of food wastage through streamlined coordination between donors, administrators, and delivery agents. The system provides a user-friendly interface for donors to register surplus food donations, specifying details such as type, quantity, and pickup time. This digitized approach replaces manual, inefficient methods, making it easier for donors to contribute regularly and systematically.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
