/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (Food wastage is a major issue causing economic loss, environmental damage, and worsening hunger. Existing food donation methods lack coordination, proper tracking, and real-time updates, resulting in inefficiencies and missed opportunities to help those in need. This project aims to develop a digital system that connects donors, administrators, and delivery agents to streamline food donations and ensure surplus food reaches beneficiaries efficiently and transparently.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
450 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (To address these challenges, the present system seeks to incorporate a web-based platform that integrates donor registration, donation listing, admin verification, and delivery assignment into a seamless workflow. By digitalizing key functions and automating manual processes, the system aims to improve coordination among stakeholders, enhance data management, and enable transparent tracking from donation to delivery. This results in a more streamlined and impactful approach to reducing food waste and feeding those in need.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
