/P 171 0 R
/E (The system must enable users \(donors, administrators, and delivery agents\) to register and authenticate securely, with distinct access rights and profiles. Donors should be able to submit detailed food donation requests, which administrators can verify, approve, and assign to delivery agents. Delivery personnel must receive, update, and track assigned pickup and drop-off tasks in real-time, allowing seamless communication and status monitoring. The platform should maintain a centralized database for storing all user data, donation details, and delivery records while providing timely notifications and reports. It must ensure accuracy, transparency, and data security throughout the donation and delivery lifecycle to achieve efficient food redistribution and waste reduction.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
