/E (The architecture of the Food Waste Management System is designed using a client-server model with a centralized web server and database. Users, including donors, administrators, and delivery agents, interact with the system through web browsers on various client devices. These clients send requests to the web server, which processes inputs such as login credentials, donation submissions, and delivery updates, and then responds with appropriate content and status information.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
